          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "address",
          "value": "<p>To my lord and master, Ab\u016b Ya\u1e25ya ibn Nissim. May God prolong his life and maintain his praise and support and happiness.</p>\n<p>From Ya\u2018q\u016bb ibn Salm\u0101n al-\u1e24ar\u012br\u012b. From Ramla.</p>\n<p>To Fust\u0101t, the House of the Money Changers, the shop of Ibr\u0101h\u012bm ibn Is\u1e25\u0101q al-T\u0101hert\u012b al-Yah\u016bd\u012b.</p>",
